f font family, like Times New Roman, but that\u2019s not to say that serif fonts can\u2019t be fresh and forward-thinking. Indeed, a lot of the finest modern typefaces are also serif fonts, building on the foundations established by those that came before, challenging the status quo of minimalistic sans serif fonts. Whether you\u2019re seeking old-style serif fonts or more modern slab serif fonts, you\u2019ll find a rich mix of serif typeface styles in our curated collection. Take a look through to find your favorite serif font type, use the filters provided to hasten your serif type search, and enter some text into the preview box to see these serif fonts in all their glory. You\u2019ll also find many other typefaces, including sans serif font options, elsewhere in our library.","parentID":3},"tracking_category":{"Category":"Fonts","CategoryID":3,"Subcategory":"Serif","SubcategoryID":80,"CategoryBranchJSON":"[{\"title\":\"Fonts\",\"id\":3},{\"title\":\"Serif\",\"id\":80}]"},"licenses":[{"id":10,"price":3400,"priceInPoints":3400},{"id":11,"price":8900,"priceInPoints":8900},{"id":13,"price":3400,"priceInPoints":3400},{"id":14,"price":3400,"priceInPoints":3400},{"id":15,"price":6800,"priceInPoints":6800},{"id":16,"price":34000,"priceInPoints":34000},{"id":17,"price":187000,"priceInPoints":187000},{"id":19,"price":89000,"priceInPoints":89000},{"id":20,"price":89000,"priceInPoints":89000},{"id":21,"price":178000,"priceInPoints":178000},{"id":22,"price":445000,"priceInPoints":445000},{"id":23,"price":890000,"priceInPoints":890000}],"activePromotion":null,"cartItemID":null,"owned":false,"action_status":{"is_liked":false,"is_saved":false,"in_cart":false},"share":{"pinterest":{"media":"https:\/\/tint.creativemarket.com\/0cBZGuhoP_YMTzw-l7HMp_m3pmGeEn7lMd6bSfGR4N0\/width:580\/height:387\/gravity:nowe\/rt:fill-down\/el:1\/czM6Ly9maWxlcy5jcmVhdGl2ZW1hcmtldC5jb20vaW1hZ2VzL3NjcmVlbnNob3RzL3Byb2R1Y3RzLzUyNTAvNTI1MDMvNTI1MDMyMzgvMDEtc2x0Zi13aW5uZXItYmFyb3F1ZS1saWdhdHVyZS1yaWNoLXNl