the page as you deliver a design that is far more personal than so many of the formal font styles you see elsewhere. You want a typeface that appears to be drawn onto the page. One that has come straight from the pen or the brush to your logos or posters in much the same way you\u2019d expect in calligraphy. Enter script fonts. A script font emulates what you\u2019ll so often see when somebody writes by hand. Ligatures connect characters in the text, giving your logo the look of one that has been designed by a person rather than pulled together by a computer. As for style, script fonts deliver attractive aesthetics by the bucketload. They\u2019re powerful exclamations that leap off the page, delivering a traditional and elegant feel to any design you create.","parentID":3},"tracking_category":{"Category":"Fonts","CategoryID":3,"Subcategory":"Script","SubcategoryID":82,"CategoryBranchJSON":"[{\"title\":\"Fonts\",\"id\":3},{\"title\":\"Script\",\"id\":82}]"},"licenses":[{"id":10,"price":1500,"priceInPoints":1500},{"id":11,"price":10000,"priceInPoints":10000},{"id":13,"price":1500,"priceInPoints":1500},{"id":14,"price":1500,"priceInPoints":1500},{"id":15,"price":3000,"priceInPoints":3000},{"id":16,"price":15000,"priceInPoints":15000},{"id":17,"price":82500,"priceInPoints":82500},{"id":18,"price":47500,"priceInPoints":47500},{"id":19,"price":60000,"priceInPoints":60000},{"id":20,"price":60000,"priceInPoints":60000},{"id":21,"price":120000,"priceInPoints":120000},{"id":22,"price":300000,"priceInPoints":300000},{"id":23,"price":600000,"priceInPoints":600000}],"activePromotion":null,"cartItemID":null,"owned":false,"action_status":{"is_liked":false,"is_saved":false,"in_cart":false},"share":{"pinterest":{"media":"https:\/\/tint.creativemarket.com\/9ZZGS-NnO3Exqw4xF6kIy7-xae2IfBCDnwOfJIMlI_E\/width:580\/height:387\/gravity:nowe\/rt:fill-down\/el:1\/czM6Ly9maWxlcy5jcmVhdGl2ZW1hcmtldC5jb20vaW1hZ2VzL3NjcmVlbnNob3RzL3Byb2R1Y3RzLzExNTEvMTE1MTQvMTE1MTQ1NTAvYXJ0Ym9hcmQtMS1vLmpwZw?16