hotos":false,"footer":"There is a level of authenticity to handwritten fonts that you simply don\u2019t see elsewhere. With these fonts, you see ligatures on full display. The small connective tissues that bind your writing make for perfect logos when you wish to convey a sense of elegance or evoke the thought of a piece developed by a true master of the design craft. A piece that comes straight from the pen or the pencil, written in script that, while it might eschew readability, feels more \u201creal\u201d to the eye. Examples of uses of handwritten fonts abound. Imagine \u201chandwritten\u201d invitations, perhaps to a wedding or a dinner party. Or, handwritten fonts that can mimic the look and feel of a signature, allowing you to digitally place on the page what would normally require the hand to write. Of course, not every handwritten font is a clear demonstration of your love of the cursive structure. Some are scratchy or written in print - variety is everywhere at Creative Market.","parentID":3},"tracking_category":{"Category":"Fonts","CategoryID":3,"Subcategory":"Handwritten","SubcategoryID":88,"CategoryBranchJSON":"[{\"title\":\"Fonts\",\"id\":3},{\"title\":\"Handwritten\",\"id\":88}]"},"licenses":[{"id":10,"price":1900,"priceInPoints":1900},{"id":11,"price":3500,"priceInPoints":3500},{"id":12,"price":21000,"priceInPoints":21000},{"id":13,"price":2200,"priceInPoints":2200},{"id":14,"price":2200,"priceInPoints":2200},{"id":15,"price":4400,"priceInPoints":4400},{"id":16,"price":22000,"priceInPoints":22000},{"id":17,"price":121000,"priceInPoints":121000},{"id":18,"price":37500,"priceInPoints":37500},{"id":19,"price":15200,"priceInPoints":15200},{"id":20,"price":15200,"priceInPoints":15200},{"id":21,"price":30400,"priceInPoints":30400},{"id":22,"price":76000,"priceInPoints":76000},{"id":23,"price":152000,"priceInPoints":152000}],"activePromotion":null,"cartItemID":null,"owned":false,"action_status":{"is_liked":false,"is_saved":false,"in_cart":false},"share":{"p